<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Plan 3.M1 / 3.A 2.2 (ledger U1940-U1941): the Emulator static library - the shared code of emu-oep, emu-snippet and
     emu-selftest (decisions 3.0.1-3.0.3). Hand-maintained (no CMake); references the fork's unicorn, capstone and keystone
     projects and includes linux-pe; deps pristine. Milestone M1: the command-line options (emu::parse_options), the
     dependency headers and the runtime no-native check (emu::host_guard). Milestone M2 (ledger U1951-U1954): the engine core
     emu::engine (CPUID profile at uc_open, D8 RNG source, memory map, verbose log), emu::reg (register dump) and
     emu::profile (the captured CPUID profiles, read-only). Milestone M3 (ledger U1972-U1975): emu::snippet (the emu-snippet v1
     executor), emu::json, emu::input_file (the one audited, read-only file input), emu::assemble (Keystone / Capstone). Milestone
     M4 (ledger U1981-U1983): emu::pe (a PE image mapped as data), emu::win sysdll (the environment's DLL capture: syscall numbers
     from its ntdll stubs, OS facts; platform profile facts) and emu::win process (PEB / TEB / KUSER from the profile, GS = TEB,
     the emulated kernel layer at the SYSCALL boundary). No native execution of guest code, no host-kernel pass-through
     (AGENT_RULES "Host safety"; suites no_native_check and no_host_passthrough). -->
